<title>USA: Amcol International Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Amcol International Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			  5,236		    4,536</p>
<p> Revs		     113,504		   92,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,481		   19,738</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.78		    $0.90</p>
<p> Net			 15,225		   17,771</p>
<p> Revs		     405,347		  347,688</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,530		   19,679</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 general selling and administrative e expenses $51,974,000 vs $44,165,000.</p>
<p>Company said difficulties in start-up of new cat litter operations during first-half 1996, coupled with temporary increase in shipping costs to meet high demand for absorbent polymer in Europe, had negative impact on full-year 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
